{
  "key": 28774,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_GiratinaCryGiygogagogwoh",
      "en_US": "Giygogagogwoh!",
      "fr_FR": "Gwogroaaaraaaah!"
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_GiratinaIsEyeingPlayer",
      "en_US": [
        "GIRATINA is quietly eyeing\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "GIRATINA étudie {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\n",
        "du regard..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_GiratinaCryGiygogagohgwooh",
      "en_US": "Giygogagohgwooh!\r",
      "fr_FR": "Gwogroaaaraaaah!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_GiratinaUnderstoodUs",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: GIRATINA seems to have\n",
        "understood us!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cynthia: GIRATINA semble avoir compris\n",
        "le message!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_ThatPokemonWasDefeated",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: That Pokémon...\r",
        "That shadowy Pokémon was defeated?!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hélio: Impossible...\r",
        "Le Pokémon de l’ombre a été vaincu?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_ThatPokemonWasCaptured",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: That Pokémon...\r",
        "That shadowy Pokémon was captured?!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hélio: Impossible...\r",
        "Le Pokémon de l’ombre a été capturé?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_YouRefusedToBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: That shadowy Pokémon...\r",
        "You quelled its rage by refusing to\n",
        "battle it?!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hélio: Le Pokémon de l’ombre...\r",
        "C’est en refusant de le combattre que\n",
        "tu as réussi à l’apaiser?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_NewWorldCantBeMade",
      "en_US": [
        "Your doing so means this irrational\n",
        "world will remain in existence!\r",
        "Does that make it impossible for me to\n",
        "create a new world?\r",
        "Even if I made new Red Chains, the new\n",
        "world can’t be made!\r",
        "Why?! What compels you to protect\n",
        "the two worlds?\r",
        "Is spirit, a vague and incomplete\n",
        "thing, so important to you?!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "A cause de toi, ce monde irrationnel va\n",
        "perdurer!\r",
        "Et moi, je ne pourrai pas créer mon\n",
        "nouveau monde!\r",
        "Même si je fabrique une autre Chaîne\n",
        "Rouge, tout est fichu!\r",
        "Pourquoi?! Qu’est-ce qui te pousse à\n",
        "protéger les deux mondes?\r",
        "L’esprit, cette chose si imparfaite et\n",
        "vague, est-il si important à tes yeux?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_PokemonUniteUs",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: ...The places we are born.\r",
        "The time we spend living...\r",
        "The languages we speak...\r",
        "We are all different.\n",
        "But the presence of Pokémon unites us.\r",
        "We share our lives with our Pokémon,\n",
        "and our happiness grows as we all\f",
        "become greater than we were alone.\r",
        "That is why we can battle and trade\n",
        "with anyone we choose...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cynthia: L’endroit où nous sommes nés,\n",
        "la vie que nous menons, la langue\f",
        "que nous parlons font de chacun de\f",
        "nous un être unique.\r",
        "Mais nous sommes tous unis par\n",
        "la présence des Pokémon.\r",
        "Nous partageons nos vies avec les\n",
        "Pokémon, et nous nous en trouvons\f",
        "aussi grandis qu’heureux.\r",
        "Grâce à cela, nous pouvons combattre\n",
        "et échanger avec qui nous voulons...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_BigSilence",
      "en_US": "{SIZE 200}Silence!{SIZE 100}\r",
      "fr_FR": "{SIZE 200}Silence!{SIZE 100}\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_EnoughBlathering",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Enough of your blathering!\r",
        "That’s how you justify spirit as\n",
        "something worthwhile?!\r",
        "That is merely humans hoping,\n",
        "deluding themselves that they are\f",
        "happy and safe!\r",
        "The emotions roiling inside me...\n",
        "Rage, hatred, frustration...\r",
        "These ugly emotions arise because of\n",
        "my own incomplete spirit!\r",
        "...Enough.\n",
        "We will never see eye to eye.\r",
        "This, I promise you.\n",
        "I will break the secrets of the world.\r",
        "With that knowledge, I will create my\n",
        "complete and perfect world.\r",
        "One day, you will awaken to a world of\n",
        "my creation.\r",
        "A world without spirit.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hélio: Assez raconté d’âneries!\r",
        "C’est comme ça que tu justifies la\n",
        "prétendue utilité de l’esprit?!\r",
        "Ce ne sont là que des illusions de joie\n",
        "et de sécurité propres aux humains!\r",
        "Les émotions m’assaillent...\n",
        "Rage, haine, frustration...\r",
        "Sentiments détestables, fruits pourris\n",
        "de mon esprit infect!\r",
        "Assez...\n",
        "Nous ne serons jamais d’accord.\r",
        "Mais je te fais une promesse.\n",
        "Je percerai les secrets du monde.\r",
        "Et je consacrerai ce savoir à la\n",
        "création d’un monde parfait.\r",
        "Un jour, tu te réveilleras dans un\n",
        "monde que j’aurai moi-même créé.\r",
        "Un monde où l’esprit sera banni\n",
        "à jamais.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_WeCanFeelJoy",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Since there is sadness, we can\n",
        "feel joy.\r",
        "When there is anger, compassion\n",
        "is born...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cynthia: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "C’est parce que nous connaissons la\n",
        "tristesse que nous ressentons la\f",
        "joie.\r",
        "De même, la colère contient les germes\n",
        "de la compassion...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_LetsGoBackHome",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s go back home.\r",
        "The portal where GIRATINA was should\n",
        "lead back to our world.\r",
        "GIRATINA was written in legend as\n",
        "being on the other side of our world.\r",
        "It stands to reason that it has a link\n",
        "to the other side."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Rentrons chez nous.\r",
        "Le portail où se trouvait GIRATINA\n",
        "devrait conduire à notre monde.\r",
        "La légende veut que GIRATINA vive de\n",
        "l’autre côté de notre monde.\r",
        "Par conséquent, il existe forcément\n",
        "un passage reliant les deux côtés."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_LeapIntoPortal",
      "en_US": [
        "There is a portal where GIRATINA was.\n",
        "Will you leap into the portal?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le portail où se trouvait GIRATINA.\n",
        "Emprunter le passage?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldGiratinaRoom_Text_PlayerLeaptIntoPortal",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} leapt into the portal.\r",
      "fr_FR": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} emprunte le passage.\r"
    }
  ]
}